  },
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "caf65d1d-0168-4152-8a01-f1da2f914b2a",
      "udi": "umb://element/32e953b4bbf745b880be75f743d19feb"
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bb963f8a-f611-4180-ad56-a3c8f122a64d",
      "udi": "umb://element/d34c82a0aa534bb990bb5248757bda29",
      "richText": {
        "markup": "<p>Safer Travel is committed to creating a Safer Transport Network in the West Midlands.<br><br>Together, West Midlands Police, British Transport Police and Transport for West Midlands make up the Safer Travel Partnership and work to identify areas of the network vulnerable to crime, anti-social and nuisance behaviour.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bb963f8a-f611-4180-ad56-a3c8f122a64d",
      "udi": "umb://element/cc3797784cb845ec8fc574373353bfd1",
      "richText": {
        "markup": "<p>Our team is intelligence led, drawn from a number of sources such as the officers, transport operators and reports from the public. The team also have access to over 1400 CCTV cameras, which are staffed 24/7 to identify and respond to incidents which are located in Bus, Rail and Metro stations.</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bb963f8a-f611-4180-ad56-a3c8f122a64d",
      "udi": "umb://element/11dad518f4514fd9a39c6c1851b7d28b",
      "richText": {
        "markup": "<h2>The Team</h2>\n<p>The Safer Travel team is made up of the following:</p>\n<p><strong>West Midlands and British Transport Police</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inspector</li>\n<li>Sergeants</li>\n<li>Constables</li>\n<li>Special Constables</li>\n<li>Police Community Support Officers</li>\n<li>Anti-Social Behaviour Officers</li>\n<li>Education Officer</li>\n<li>Communication Officer</li>\n<li>Intelligence Analyst</li>\n<li>Police Staff Investigator</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Transport for West Midlands</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Head of Security and Policing</li>\n<li>Security and Policing Manager</li>\n<li>Transport Safety Officers</li>\n<li>CCTV Control</li>\n<li>Drone Team</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Transport Operators</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>National Express Safer Travel Manager</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "blocks": {
          "contentData": [],
          "settingsData": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "25b87395-cb8c-4120-a01c-8a8fc3c946bd",
